{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"80fe59917a8a93095732223375ef4503e7def9f0321ce74282d27faef27b455f","ja":"取り寄せれば思い出に","zh":"订来之后，就会成为回忆","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"eff21fa29e1036d0bb23f5407afd41300b84e12b787e8f77df78e8414592420d","ja":"わあ！？　は、ハンバーガーっ！　伊織ちゃん\r\n見てください！　ハンバーガーがありますよ！","zh":"哇！？　汉、汉堡包！　小伊织\n快看！　有汉堡包哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a5019dab5775292e77e41fc61352a546eb914b4786ff49b857d921231b76174a","ja":"なによ、そんなにハンバーガーが珍しいの？\n……ああ、お取り寄せサイトに載ってたのね。","zh":"什么嘛，汉堡有那么稀奇吗？\n……啊，是网购网站上卖的那个啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2eb832e94836f0c3ed87aab422c0691f8f8617ec6d10937bac494b057033c849","ja":"公演の時のこと思い出しながら選んでるんだよ。\nご当地のハンバーガーも、面白くていいね。","zh":"一边回忆着演出时的事情一边挑选呢。当地的汉堡也很有趣，真不错呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"62acf739eb0f9613e077f02bfddaebeedb160145f99bfd5afb3ade5a524566b7","ja":"ふうん……じゃあ未来はハンバーガーで決定なのね。\n私もひとつふたつ見つくろっておかなくちゃ。","zh":"这样啊……那未来就选汉堡了啊。\n我也得挑一两个才行。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ae01c4716d985e4ca86486ddcd55e0c120e65ae393b5ce4d905c4a477fa1c005","ja":"え！？　け、決定っていうか……。\n……ひ、ひとつかふたつ……？","zh":"诶！？　也、也不算定下来了……。\n……一、一两个……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"20d51f069f322f5daf0a284f3b54433a844483ec8c877876cf25c743c7c1ad3c","ja":"えっと……。\n私、もうちょっと悩もうかな～って……。","zh":"那个……。\n我再稍微纠结一下～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2386ad08ac2e96197a9ebe8e7845c31ea11cff6907fca876509842c29fb21ecc","ja":"……あやしい。\n未来さん、ちょっとスマホみせて！","zh":"……可疑。\n未来，让我看看你的手机！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142","ja":"あっ！","zh":"啊！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"02ef464f4b56c873a31fd8bc00e104f65b08a6cdca28215012545932bb70af8f","ja":"和牛セットにうどん、もつ鍋、明太子……\nやっぱり！　これはさすがに頼みすぎじゃない？","zh":"和牛套餐、乌冬面、牛肠锅、明太子……\n果然！这个是不是点得太多了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1fe2614250449dfd6e16f97e036d1f20a3668e1693a4a6360811cca58522f1e6","ja":"だって、全部おいしかったから……。","zh":"因为全都很好吃嘛……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8bdd54fa919fef3950e9031df0b663b0a57ffbd9480667366ccf0323c4ce20da","ja":"でも大丈夫！　まだカートに入れただけだから！\nすぐにキャンセルするから～！","zh":"不过没关系！　只是放进购物车而已！\n我马上就取消～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"05f753d7374d2712de81f058e27ffd1c74737f822d4ad2b0b543981b37d7f6d7","ja":"はあ……まったく、食いしん坊なんだから。","zh":"唉……真是的，真是个贪吃鬼。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b1820bb3218a1d62610e4c361f5594e8f1618e214b8cf83ba3a59e0c24d6b515","ja":"未来ちゃん、たくさん選んでたのね。でも、\nひとりで食べる量ではなかったみたいだけど……？","zh":"小未来，选了好多呢。但是，\n看起来不是一个人能吃完的量……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"ae128ab47f5069f530541459064f1a004787c761ba923db3be6d9d97bfa9e0fa","ja":"きっと、劇場のみんなの分ですね～。お取り寄せした\nもので、思い出を作りたいのかもしれませんな～。","zh":"一定是给剧场里大家的那份呢～。是订购来的\n东西，可能是想创造回忆吧～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"836cfb8ec8bc2c8470ef9c2e3a4c5b41dbe23fb8824e1207959d0476377ec8de","ja":"劇場のみんなとも思い出を……。\n確かに、とっても未来ちゃんらしいかも……♪","zh":"和剧场的大家也留下了回忆……。\n确实很像小未来呢……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"9f810636b044d8a1d567aa49eeb41d1f763f790865a666f58f251e5e4de7d2aa","ja":"そういうことなら、もう少し頼んでおかなくちゃ。\n未来ちゃんにも手伝ってもらいましょう♪","zh":"既然是这样，那就得再多拜托一点了。\n也让小未来来帮忙吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_929.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"fef571867d99f9571f20a7f9cdae8ea7764045505596342ddcbe158737e5a864","ja":"はい～。では未来ちゃんを呼んで、まずは\r\nキャンセルのキャンセルからですな～♪","zh":"好的～。那么叫小未来，首先\n从取消的取消开始呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
